{"id":"steam-746590","steam":746590,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Quadra","summary":"Get good and get fast with Quadra, a high-speed match-3 game that will test your reflexes. Don't be a square, play Quadra!","about":"Quadra features fast-paced, addicting gameplay that tests your dexterity and challenges you to think spatially.\r\n\r\nRotate the game board to quickly and strategically place colored blocks as they spawn. Match 3 colors to clear them and gain points -- if a block stack reaches the center, you lose!\r\n\r\n\n• Lightning-fast gameplay\r\n• Meet all kinds of adorable blocks\r\n• Unlock powerful new super block types\r\n• Place blocks just right to unleash huge combos\r\n• Rank up to gold and beyond on every level\r\n• Play on the go! Coming to iOS\n\r\n\r\n\r\nVisit our website (use the link in the sidebar) or find Quadra on Itch to try the free demo before buying!\r\n\r\nThis game contains flashing imagery. Please be cautious if you have a history of photosensitive seizures.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/portrait.png?t=1520491283","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/header.jpg?t=1520491283","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1520491283","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/header.jpg?t=1520491283","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1520491283","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/ss_57603c4fe920a76d25fa0d520cf052c0cd286e48.600x338.jpg?t=1520491283","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/ss_57603c4fe920a76d25fa0d520cf052c0cd286e48.jpg?t=1520491283"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/ss_414